An explicitly-defaulted (`= default`) copy/move constructor must memberwise
copy/move the base subobjects and non-static data members, exactly like the
implicitly-defined one ([dcl.fct.def.default], [class.copy.ctor]/14).  The
memberwise body is generated at conversion time for trivially-copyable
bases/members.  Covers class templates, a non-template class, and a class
with a base subobject.
